{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a **premium Trustpilot-inspired Customer Reviews Section** for Shopify that matches the aesthetic of modern luxury ecommerce brands such as ICON Amsterdam, Represent, and Cole Buxton.
    
    The section should feel **sleek, minimal, trustworthy, conversion-focused, and high-end**, while maintaining exceptional performance and responsiveness across all devices.
    
    ## Design Direction
    
    The overall design should emphasize:
    
    * Clean luxury fashion brand aesthetics
    * Strong typography hierarchy
    * Generous whitespace
    * Minimal visual clutter
    * Premium user experience
    * Trust and social proof
    * Modern ecommerce best practices
    
    The section should look equally polished on desktop and mobile.
    
    ---
    
    ## Mobile-First & Responsive Requirements
    
    This section must be heavily optimized for both desktop and mobile layouts.
    
    ### Desktop Experience
    
    * Elegant horizontal review carousel
    * Multiple review cards visible at once
    * Smooth navigation arrows
    * Balanced spacing and proportions
    * Maximum content width controls
    * Luxury storefront appearance
    
    ### Mobile Experience
    
    * Mobile layout must remain sleek and compact
    * Avoid oversized review cards or excessive vertical height
    * Reduce padding and spacing intelligently on smaller screens
    * Keep the section visually lightweight
    * Swipe-enabled carousel
    * Smooth touch interactions
    * Maintain readability without occupying excessive screen space
    * Prevent horizontal overflow at all costs
    * Ensure no content extends beyond viewport width
    * Optimize for iPhone and Android devices
    
    The section should feel premium and efficient rather than bulky on mobile.
    
    ---
    
    ## Section Structure
    
    ### Trust Summary Header
    
    Include a trust summary area above the reviews featuring:
    
    * Average star rating
    * Review count
    * Trustpilot logo upload option
    * Optional custom logo upload
    * Small trust indicators
    
    Example:
    
    ★★★★★ 4.8/5
    
    Based on 38,000+ reviews
    
    Trusted by customers worldwide
    
    All text should be editable through theme settings.
    
    ---
    
    ## Review Carousel
    
    Create a smooth carousel containing review cards.
    
    Features:
    
    * Swipe support on mobile
    * Navigation arrows on desktop
    * Optional pagination dots
    * Infinite looping
    * Adjustable autoplay speed
    * Pause autoplay on hover
    * Smooth transitions
    * Equal-height review cards
    
    ---
    
    ## Review Card Content
    
    Each review block should support:
    
    * Star rating (1–5)
    * Review headline
    * Review text
    * Customer name
    * Date
    * Verified customer badge
    * Optional customer image/avatar
    
    ---
    
    ## Review Card Styling
    
    Cards should feature:
    
    * White or customizable background
    * Subtle borders
    * Optional shadows
    * Adjustable border radius
    * Premium typography
    * Balanced spacing
    * Consistent card heights
    
    Hover effects should be subtle and modern.
    
    No flashy animations.
    
    ---
    
    ## Theme Editor Customization
    
    Create extensive customization options inside the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ### Content Controls
    
    * Section heading
    * Section subheading
    * Trust score
    * Total review count
    * Trustpilot logo upload
    * Custom logo upload
    * Up to 50 review blocks
    
    ### Review Block Controls
    
    Each review should have:
    
    * Customer name
    * Review title
    * Review text
    * Star rating
    * Date
    * Verified toggle
    * Customer image
    
    ### Design Controls
    
    * Background color
    * Card background color
    * Heading color
    * Text color
    * Star color
    * Border color
    * Verified badge color
    * Section width
    * Section padding
    * Card padding
    * Border radius
    * Shadow intensity
    * Typography sizes
    
    ### Carousel Controls
    
    * Cards per row on desktop
    * Cards per row on tablet
    * Cards per row on mobile
    * Autoplay toggle
    * Autoplay speed
    * Arrow visibility
    * Pagination dots visibility
    * Infinite loop toggle
    
    ---
    
    ## Trust Bar (Optional)
    
    Add an optional trust bar above the reviews with editable icon/text blocks.
    
    Examples:
    
    * Fast Worldwide Shipping
    * Easy Returns
    * Secure Checkout
    * 38,000+ Happy Customers
    
    Fully customizable within Theme Editor.
    
    ---
    
    ## Performance Requirements
    
    The section must be production-ready and optimized for Shopify stores.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Native Shopify Liquid section
    * No jQuery
    * Lightweight vanilla JavaScript only
    * Fast loading
    * Lazy-loaded images
    * Accessibility compliant
    * Keyboard navigation support
    * SEO-friendly structure
    * CLS-safe layout
    * No layout shifting
    * No unnecessary dependencies
    
    ---
    
    ## Technical Requirements
    
    Generate a complete Shopify section file including:
    
    * Liquid
    * CSS
    * JavaScript
    * Fully structured schema
    
    All content, styling, spacing, typography, carousel behavior, and layout settings should be editable from the Shopify Theme Editor without modifying code.
    
    The final result should resemble a premium Trustpilot-style review section used by luxury ecommerce brands while remaining sleek, lightweight, and highly optimized on both desktop and mobile devices.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-reviews-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_mobile }}px 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_desktop }}px 40px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.section_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-reviews-trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-trust-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-trust-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-reviews-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size_mobile }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size_desktop }}px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-trust-summary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-trust-summary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-rating-display-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-reviews-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .ai-reviews-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    color: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-score-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-score-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 22px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-count-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-count-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 100px;
    height: auto;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: 120px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 0 -20px;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap_mobile }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap_desktop }}px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-reviews-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc(100% - 40px);
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding_mobile }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    min-height: 200px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 550px) {
    .ai-reviews-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(50% - {{ block.settings.card_gap_mobile | divided_by: 2 }}px);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc((100% / {{ block.settings.cards_per_row_desktop }}) - ({{ block.settings.card_gap_desktop }} * ({{ block.settings.cards_per_row_desktop }} - 1) / {{ block.settings.cards_per_row_desktop }})px);
      padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding_desktop }}px;
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }

  {% if block.settings.card_shadow_intensity > 0 %}
    .ai-reviews-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity | times: 2 }}px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-reviews-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity | plus: 4 }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_intensity | times: 3 }}px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .ai-reviews-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-reviews-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-reviews-card-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-reviews-card-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-card-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-card-date-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-card-date-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-card-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .ai-reviews-card-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-card-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-verified-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: {{ block.settings.verified_color }};
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-verified-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-verified-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }

  .ai-reviews-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-reviews-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-reviews-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.3;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .ai-reviews-nav-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .ai-reviews-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-reviews-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .ai-reviews-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-reviews-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    width: 24px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<customer-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-reviews-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-reviews-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.show_trust_bar %}
      <div class="ai-reviews-trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          {% liquid
            assign trust_text_key = 'trust_text_' | append: i
            assign trust_text = block.settings[trust_text_key]
          %}
          {% if trust_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-reviews-trust-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg class="ai-reviews-trust-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
              <span>{{ trust_text }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-reviews-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-reviews-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
        <p class="ai-reviews-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="ai-reviews-trust-summary-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-reviews-rating-display-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-reviews-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% for i in (1..5) %}
              <svg class="ai-reviews-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
              </svg>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          <span class="ai-reviews-score-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.trust_score }}</span>
        </div>

        {% if block.settings.review_count != blank %}
          <p class="ai-reviews-count-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Based on {{ block.settings.review_count }} reviews</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.trust_logo != blank %}
          <img src="{{ block.settings.trust_logo | image_url: width: 240 }}" alt="Trust logo" class="ai-reviews-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}" loading="lazy">
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-reviews-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-reviews-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-carousel>
        {% for i in (1..50) %}
          {% liquid
            assign name_key = 'customer_name_' | append: i
            assign date_key = 'review_date_' | append: i
            assign image_key = 'customer_image_' | append: i
            assign rating_key = 'star_rating_' | append: i
            assign title_key = 'review_title_' | append: i
            assign text_key = 'review_text_' | append: i
            assign verified_key = 'verified_' | append: i

            assign customer_name = block.settings[name_key]
            assign review_date = block.settings[date_key]
            assign customer_image = block.settings[image_key]
            assign star_rating = block.settings[rating_key]
            assign review_title = block.settings[title_key]
            assign review_text = block.settings[text_key]
            assign verified = block.settings[verified_key]
          %}

          {% if customer_name != blank or review_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-reviews-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-reviews-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if customer_image != blank %}
                  <img src="{{ customer_image | image_url: width: 80 }}" alt="{{ customer_name }}" class="ai-reviews-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }}" loading="lazy">
                {% else %}
                  <div class="ai-reviews-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="ai-reviews-card-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if customer_name != blank %}
                    <h3 class="ai-reviews-card-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ customer_name }}</h3>
                  {% endif %}
                  {% if review_date != blank %}
                    <p class="ai-reviews-card-date-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ review_date }}</p>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="ai-reviews-card-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% for j in (1..star_rating) %}
                  <svg class="ai-reviews-card-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                    <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
                  </svg>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>

              {% if review_title != blank %}
                <h4 class="ai-reviews-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ review_title }}</h4>
              {% endif %}

              {% if review_text != blank %}
                <p class="ai-reviews-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ review_text }}</p>
              {% endif %}

              {% if verified %}
                <div class="ai-reviews-verified-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg class="ai-reviews-verified-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                    <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span>Verified Purchase</span>
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.show_dots %}
        <div class="ai-reviews-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-dots></div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.show_arrows %}
      <div class="ai-reviews-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-reviews-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-prev aria-label="Previous reviews">
          <svg class="ai-reviews-nav-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ai-reviews-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-next aria-label="Next reviews">
          <svg class="ai-reviews-nav-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</customer-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function() {
  class CustomerReviews{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    constructor() {
      super();
      this.carousel = this.querySelector('[data-carousel]');
      this.prevButton = this.querySelector('[data-prev]');
      this.nextButton = this.querySelector('[data-next]');
      this.dotsContainer = this.querySelector('[data-dots]');
      this.cards = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-reviews-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      this.currentIndex = 0;
      this.autoplayInterval = null;
      this.cardsPerView = {{ block.settings.cards_per_row_desktop }};
      this.autoplayEnabled = {{ block.settings.enable_autoplay }};
      this.autoplaySpeed = {{ block.settings.autoplay_speed | times: 1000 }};
      this.infiniteLoop = {{ block.settings.infinite_loop }};
    }

    connectedCallback() {
      if (!this.carousel || this.cards.length === 0) return;

      this.updateCardsPerView();
      this.setupNavigation();
      this.setupDots();
      this.setupTouchEvents();
      
      if (this.autoplayEnabled) {
        this.startAutoplay();
      }

      window.addEventListener('resize', this.handleResize.bind(this));
    }

    disconnectedCallback() {
      this.stopAutoplay();
      window.removeEventListener('resize', this.handleResize.bind(this));
    }

    updateCardsPerView() {
      const width = window.innerWidth;
      if (width < 550) {
        this.cardsPerView = 1;
      } else if (width < 750) {
        this.cardsPerView = 2;
      } else {
        this.cardsPerView = {{ block.settings.cards_per_row_desktop }};
      }
    }

    handleResize() {
      this.updateCardsPerView();
      this.updateCarousel();
    }

    setupNavigation() {
      if (this.prevButton && this.nextButton) {
        this.prevButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
          this.stopAutoplay();
          this.prev();
          if (this.autoplayEnabled) this.startAutoplay();
        });

        this.nextButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
          this.stopAutoplay();
          this.next();
          if (this.autoplayEnabled) this.startAutoplay();
        });

        this.carousel.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => this.stopAutoplay());
        this.carousel.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
          if (this.autoplayEnabled) this.startAutoplay();
        });
      }

      this.updateNavButtons();
    }

    setupDots() {
      if (!this.dotsContainer) return;

      const totalDots = Math.ceil(this.cards.length / this.cardsPerView);
      this.dotsContainer.innerHTML = '';

      for (let i = 0; i < totalDots; i++) {
        const dot = document.createElement('button');
        dot.className = 'ai-reviews-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
        dot.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Go to slide ' + (i + 1));
        if (i === 0) dot.classList.add('active');
        
        dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
          this.stopAutoplay();
          this.goToSlide(i);
          if (this.autoplayEnabled) this.startAutoplay();
        });

        this.dotsContainer.appendChild(dot);
      }
    }

    setupTouchEvents() {
      let startX = 0;
      let scrollLeft = 0;

      this.carousel.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {
        startX = e.touches[0].pageX;
        scrollLeft = this.carousel.scrollLeft;
      });

      this.carousel.addEventListener('touchmove', (e) => {
        const x = e.touches[0].pageX;
        const walk = (startX - x) * 2;
        this.carousel.scrollLeft = scrollLeft + walk;
      });

      this.carousel.addEventListener('touchend', () => {
        this.snapToCard();
      });
    }

    snapToCard() {
      const cardWidth = this.cards[0].offsetWidth;
      const gap = {{ block.settings.card_gap_mobile }};
      const scrollPosition = this.carousel.scrollLeft;
      const index = Math.round(scrollPosition / (cardWidth + gap));
      this.goToSlide(index);
    }

    goToSlide(index) {
      const maxIndex = Math.ceil(this.cards.length / this.cardsPerView) - 1;
      this.currentIndex = Math.max(0, Math.min(index, maxIndex));
      this.updateCarousel();
    }

    updateCarousel() {
      const cardWidth = this.cards[0].offsetWidth;
      const gap = window.innerWidth >= 750 ? {{ block.settings.card_gap_desktop }} : {{ block.settings.card_gap_mobile }};
      const scrollAmount = (cardWidth + gap) * this.currentIndex * this.cardsPerView;

      this.carousel.scrollTo({
        left: scrollAmount,
        behavior: 'smooth'
      });

      this.updateNavButtons();
      this.updateDots();
    }

    updateNavButtons() {
      if (!this.prevButton || !this.nextButton) return;

      const maxIndex = Math.ceil(this.cards.length / this.cardsPerView) - 1;

      if (this.infiniteLoop) {
        this.prevButton.disabled = false;
        this.nextButton.disabled = false;
      } else {
        this.prevButton.disabled = this.currentIndex === 0;
        this.nextButton.disabled = this.currentIndex >= maxIndex;
      }
    }

    updateDots() {
      if (!this.dotsContainer) return;

      const dots = this.dotsContainer.querySelectorAll('.ai-reviews-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
        if (index === this.currentIndex) {
          dot.classList.add('active');
        } else {
          dot.classList.remove('active');
        }
      });
    }

    next() {
      const maxIndex = Math.ceil(this.cards.length / this.cardsPerView) - 1;
      
      if (this.currentIndex >= maxIndex) {
        if (this.infiniteLoop) {
          this.currentIndex = 0;
        }
      } else {
        this.currentIndex++;
      }
      
      this.updateCarousel();
    }

    prev() {
      const maxIndex = Math.ceil(this.cards.length / this.cardsPerView) - 1;
      
      if (this.currentIndex <= 0) {
        if (this.infiniteLoop) {
          this.currentIndex = maxIndex;
        }
      } else {
        this.currentIndex--;
      }
      
      this.updateCarousel();
    }

    startAutoplay() {
      this.stopAutoplay();
      this.autoplayInterval = setInterval(() => {
        this.next();
      }, this.autoplaySpeed);
    }

    stopAutoplay() {
      if (this.autoplayInterval) {
        clearInterval(this.autoplayInterval);
        this.autoplayInterval = null;
      }
    }
  }

  customElements.define('customer-reviews-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CustomerReviews{{ ai_gen_id }});
})();
</script>

